{"bg_img":"https:\/\/www.sinopeg.com.cn\/uploadfile\/image\/20250718\/20250718092516_57966.png","category_id":"6a15761c36fd3b1e17366834","column_id":"6a154fc77093015d5705df9a","create_time":"2025-06-27 09:22:46","details":"<span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#337FE5;\">Review Research (Wash D C). 2024 Jun 18:7:0370.&nbsp; doi: 10.34133\/research.0370.&nbsp; eCollection 2024.<\/span><br \/>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>Unlocking the Therapeutic Applicability of LNP-mRNA: Chemistry, Formulation, and Clinical Strategies<\/strong><\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<br \/>\r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><strong>摘要<\/strong><\/span><br \/>\r\n<span style=\"font-size:14px;\">信使RNA （mRNA）已成为一种创新的治疗方式，为预防和治疗多种疾病提供了有希望的途径。mRNA疫苗在有效抗击2019冠状病毒病（COVID-19）方面取得的巨大成功，证明了mRNA技术的无限医疗潜力。脂质纳米颗粒（LNPs）的最新进展使得克服mRNA稳定性、免疫原性和精确靶向方面的挑战成为可能。本文综述了最新的基于lnp - mrna的治疗方法，包括它们的结构、材料组成、设计指南和筛选原则。此外，我们还强调了目前LNP-mRNA治疗在眼科疾病、癌症免疫治疗、基因编辑和罕见疾病医学等广泛治疗中的临床前和临床趋势。特别关注LNP-mRNA疫苗的翻译和进化，使其成为更广泛的治疗方法。我们探讨了肝外靶向疗效不足、剂量升高、安全性问题和大规模生产程序的挑战等方面的问题。这一讨论可能为LNP-mRNA治疗的近期和长期临床发展前景提供见解和观点。<\/span> \r\n<\/p>\r\n<p>\r\n\t<span background-color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; display: block; color: rgb(9, 9, 9); font-family: \"><strong><br \/>\r\n<\/strong><\/span><span background-color:#ffffff;font-size:18px;\"=\"\" microsoft=\"\" yahei\",=\"\" \"microsoft=\"\" yahei-regular\";=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 14px;=\"\" text-wrap-mode:=\"\" wrap;=\"\" background-color:=\"\" rgb(255,=\"\" 255,=\"\" 255);\"=\"\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; border-style: none; border-color: inherit; border-width: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style-type: none; margin-t